{"strongs": "H0216", "word": "אוֺר", "translit": "or", "root": "אור", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "light", "definition": "אוֺר 121 noun masculine Gen 1:3 ( feminine Job 36:32 ; Jer 13:16 ) light (Assyrian urru = ûru Dl w ). — absolute Gen 1:3 +; construct Judg 16:2 +; suffix אוֺרִי Ps 27:1 , etc.; plural אוֺרִים Ps 136:7 — 1. light as diffused in nature, light of day Gen 1:3 ; Gen 1:4 ; Gen 1:5 ( P ) Job 3:9 ; Job 38:19 +. 2. morning light, dawn , אוֺר הַבֹּקֶר light of the morning Judg 16:2 ; 1Sam 14:36 ; 1Sam 25:34 ; 1Sam 25:36 ; 2Sam 17:22 ; 2Kgs 7:9 ; Mic 2:1 בֹּקֶר ׳ א 2Sam 23:4 (poem of David); ׳ עַדהָֿא Judg 19:26 (compare עַדהַֿבֹּקֶר v Judg 19:25 ); לָאוֺר Job 24:14 מִןהָֿאוֺר עַד מַחֲצִית הַיּוֺם from dawn till mid-day , Neh 8:3 compare Prov 4:18 . 3. light of the heavenly luminaries; הַלְּבָנָה ׳ א , || הַחַמָּה ׳ א moonlight & sunlight Isa 30:26 כּוֺכְבֵי אוֺר stars of light Ps 148:3 מְאוֺרֵי אוֺר luminaries of light Ezek 32:8 אוֺרִים = מְאוֺרִים Ps 136:7 so עֲלֵיאֿוֺר in sunshine Isa 18:4 the sun itself Job 31:26 . 4. daylight אוֺר רְשָׁעִים light of the wicked Job 38:15 (their work-day being the night); יוֺם אוֺר a day of light Amos 8:9 (= a clear, sunshiny day). 5. lightning Job 36:32 ; Job 37:3 ; Job 37:11 ; Job 37:15 compare Hab 3:11 . 6. light of lamp Prov 13:9 ; Jer 25:10 of crocodile's hot breath Job 41:10 . 7. light of life חַיִּים ׳ א Job 33:30 ; Ps 56:14 compare אוֺר Job 3:16 ; Job 3:20 . 8. light of prosperity Job 22:28 ; Job 30:26 ; Ps 97:11 ; Lam 3:2 . 9. light of instruction נֵר מִצְוָה וְתוֺרָה אוֺר Prov 6:23 the commandment is a lamp and instruction a light ; so the Messian. servant is אוֺר גּוֺיִם Isa 42:6 ; Isa 49:6 compare עַמִּים ׳ א Isa 51:4 the advent of Messiah is shining of great light Isa 9:1 (twice in verse). 10. light of face אוֺר פָּנִים = bright, cheerful face (of men) Job 29:24 betokening king's favour Prov 16:15 (compare עֵינַיִם ׳ א Ps 38:11 ); of God = his shining, enlightening, favouring face Ps 4:7 ; Ps 44:4 ; Ps 89:16 . 11. Yahweh is יִשְׂרָאֵל ׳ א Isa 10:17 , as source enlightenment & prosperity; light & salvation Ps 27:1 light to guide Mic 7:8 compare Ps 43:3 everlasting light of Zion, instead of sun & moon Isa 60:19 ; Isa 60:20 house of Jacob is to walk in his light Isa 2:5 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB237')\">BDB237</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H216')\">H216</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB236')\">BDB236</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB238')\">BDB238</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אוֺר</bdbheb><sub>121</sub> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Gen 1:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,3)\">Gen 1:3</ref></sup> (<b>feminine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Job 36:32\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,32)\">Job 36:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 13:16\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(24,13,16)\">Jer 13:16</ref></sup>) <highlightword>light</highlightword> (Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>urru = ûru</highlight></transliteration> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dl')\">Dl<sup>w</sup></lookup>). — absolute <ref ref=\"Gen 1:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,3)\">Gen 1:3</ref> +; construct <ref ref=\"Judg 16:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,2)\">Judg 16:2</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>אוֺרִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 27:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,1)\">Ps 27:1</ref>, etc.; <highlight>plural</highlight> <bdbheb>אוֺרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 136:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"136\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"136\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,136,7)\">Ps 136:7</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>light</highlight> as diffused in nature, light of day <ref ref=\"Gen 1:3\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,3)\">Gen 1:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:4\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,4)\">Gen 1:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 1:5\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(1,1,5)\">Gen 1:5</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>) <ref ref=\"Job 3:9\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,9)\">Job 3:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 38:19\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,19)\">Job 38:19</ref> +. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>morning light, dawn</highlight>, <bdbheb>אוֺר הַבֹּקֶר</bdbheb> light of the morning <ref ref=\"Judg 16:2\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(7,16,2)\">Judg 16:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 14:36\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(9,14,36)\">1Sam 14:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:34\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,34)\">1Sam 25:34</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 25:36\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(9,25,36)\">1Sam 25:36</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Sam 17:22\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(10,17,22)\">2Sam 17:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 7:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,7,9)\">2Kgs 7:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mic 2:1\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(33,2,1)\">Mic 2:1</ref> <bdbheb>בֹּקֶר</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Sam 23:4\" b=\"10\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(10,23,4)\">2Sam 23:4</ref> (poem of David); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עַדהָֿא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 19:26\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,26)\">Judg 19:26</ref> (compare <bdbheb>עַדהַֿבֹּקֶר</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Judg 19:25\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(7,19,25)\">Judg 19:25</ref>); <bdbheb>לָאוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 24:14\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,14)\">Job 24:14</ref> <bdbheb>מִןהָֿאוֺר עַד מַחֲצִית הַיּוֺם</bdbheb> <highlight>from dawn till mid-day</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Neh 8:3\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(16,8,3)\">Neh 8:3</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Prov 4:18\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(20,4,18)\">Prov 4:18</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>light</highlight> of the heavenly luminaries; <bdbheb>הַלְּבָנָה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb>, || <bdbheb>הַחַמָּה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <highlight>moonlight &amp; sunlight</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 30:26\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(23,30,26)\">Isa 30:26</ref> <bdbheb>כּוֺכְבֵי אוֺר</bdbheb> <highlight>stars of light</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ps 148:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"148\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"148\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,148,3)\">Ps 148:3</ref> <bdbheb>מְאוֺרֵי אוֺר</bdbheb> <highlight>luminaries of light</highlight> <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,8)\">Ezek 32:8</ref> <bdbheb>אוֺרִים</bdbheb> = <bdbheb>מְאוֺרִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 136:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"136\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"136\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,136,7)\">Ps 136:7</ref> so <bdbheb>עֲלֵיאֿוֺר</bdbheb> <highlight>in sunshine</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 18:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,18,4)\">Isa 18:4</ref> the sun itself <ref ref=\"Job 31:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,31,26)\">Job 31:26</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> <highlight>daylight</highlight> <bdbheb>אוֺר רְשָׁעִים</bdbheb> <highlight>light of the wicked</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 38:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,38,15)\">Job 38:15</ref> (their work-day being the night); <bdbheb>יוֺם אוֺר</bdbheb> <highlight>a day of light</highlight> <ref ref=\"Amos 8:9\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,9)\">Amos 8:9</ref> (= a clear, sunshiny day). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <highlight>lightning</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 36:32\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(18,36,32)\">Job 36:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 37:3\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,3)\">Job 37:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 37:11\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,11)\">Job 37:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 37:15\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(18,37,15)\">Job 37:15</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Hab 3:11\" b=\"35\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(35,3,11)\">Hab 3:11</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> <highlight>light</highlight> of lamp <ref ref=\"Prov 13:9\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(20,13,9)\">Prov 13:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 25:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(24,25,10)\">Jer 25:10</ref> of crocodile's hot breath <ref ref=\"Job 41:10\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"41\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"41\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(18,41,10)\">Job 41:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>7.</b> <highlight>light of life</highlight> <bdbheb>חַיִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 33:30\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"33\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"33\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(18,33,30)\">Job 33:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 56:14\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(19,56,14)\">Ps 56:14</ref> compare <bdbheb>אוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 3:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,16)\">Job 3:16</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 3:20\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(18,3,20)\">Job 3:20</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>8.</b> <highlight>light of prosperity</highlight> <ref ref=\"Job 22:28\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"28\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"28\" onclick=\"bcv(18,22,28)\">Job 22:28</ref>; <ref ref=\"Job 30:26\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(18,30,26)\">Job 30:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 97:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"97\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"97\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,97,11)\">Ps 97:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lam 3:2\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(25,3,2)\">Lam 3:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>9.</b> <highlight>light of instruction</highlight> <bdbheb>נֵר מִצְוָה וְתוֺרָה אוֺר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Prov 6:23\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(20,6,23)\">Prov 6:23</ref> <highlight>the commandment</highlight> is <highlight>a lamp and instruction a light</highlight>; so the Messian. servant is <bdbheb>אוֺר גּוֺיִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 42:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"42\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"42\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,42,6)\">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 49:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,6)\">Isa 49:6</ref> compare <bdbheb>עַמִּים</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 51:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,4)\">Isa 51:4</ref> the advent of Messiah is shining of great light <ref ref=\"Isa 9:1\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,1)\">Isa 9:1</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>10.</b> <highlight>light</highlight> of face <bdbheb>אוֺר פָּנִים</bdbheb> = bright, cheerful face (of men) <ref ref=\"Job 29:24\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"29\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(18,29,24)\">Job 29:24</ref> betokening king's favour <ref ref=\"Prov 16:15\" b=\"20\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(20,16,15)\">Prov 16:15</ref> (compare <bdbheb>עֵינַיִם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 38:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,38,11)\">Ps 38:11</ref>); of God = his shining, enlightening, favouring face <ref ref=\"Ps 4:7\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(19,4,7)\">Ps 4:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 44:4\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(19,44,4)\">Ps 44:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 89:16\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"89\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"89\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(19,89,16)\">Ps 89:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>11.</b> Yahweh is <bdbheb>יִשְׂרָאֵל</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>א</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:17\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,17)\">Isa 10:17</ref>, as source enlightenment &amp; prosperity; light &amp; salvation <ref ref=\"Ps 27:1\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(19,27,1)\">Ps 27:1</ref> light to guide <ref ref=\"Mic 7:8\" b=\"33\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(33,7,8)\">Mic 7:8</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Ps 43:3\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"43\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"43\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(19,43,3)\">Ps 43:3</ref> everlasting light of Zion, instead of sun &amp; moon <ref ref=\"Isa 60:19\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,19)\">Isa 60:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 60:20\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"60\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"60\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(23,60,20)\">Isa 60:20</ref> house of Jacob is to walk in his light <ref ref=\"Isa 2:5\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(23,2,5)\">Isa 2:5</r